### Windows
# Windows thumbnail cache files
Thumbs.db

# Folder config file
[Dd]esktop.ini

# Recycle Bin used on file shares
$RECYCLE.BIN/

# Windows shortcuts
*.lnk

### Agentheim dashboard runtime
# Sole runtime state on disk (pid/port runfile); never committed. See ADR-0002.
.agentheim/.dashboard/

### Agentheim advisory state (ADR-0027)
# Machine-written, single-latest, overwritten advisory signals (e.g. the
# whats-next recommendation). Transient working state, not versioned knowledge.
.agentheim/state/

### Agentheim dashboard build tooling
# esbuild + framework deps are BUILD-TIME only (ADR-0003); never committed.
# The committed artifacts are dashboard/dist/, build.mjs, package.json (+ lock).
dashboard/node_modules/

### Agentheim VS Code bridge extension (infrastructure-013, ADR-0018)
# @vscode/vsce is a PACKAGING-TIME-only dep; the runtime is stdlib + the vscode
# host API. node_modules and built .vsix artifacts are never committed.
vscode-extension/node_modules/
vscode-extension/*.vsix

### Agentheim per-worker git worktrees (ADR-0032)
# Each parallel `work` worker gets a private worktree at <repo-root>/.worktrees/<task-id>/
# on branch aw/<task-id> — harness scratch, never a real project artifact, so it lives
# outside .agentheim/ and is never committed. Removed on PASS/SKIP; kept (and surfaced to
# the user) on a FAIL-iteration-3 escalation or an unresolved merge-back conflict.
/.worktrees/